# Copy to .env.local and fill in.

# --- Required for live answers -------------------------------------------
# Without this the app still runs: the trail library, search, and replay all
# work, and /api/ask returns a clear "live answers are off" message rather
# than failing opaquely.
# Get one at https://console.anthropic.com
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# --- Optional: shared, persistent team memory -----------------------------
# Unset, Cairn uses an in-memory store: seeded on boot, resets when the server
# sleeps. Fine for a local run or a solo demo.
#
# Set both, and trails become genuinely shared across everyone hitting the
# deployment — which is what makes the team-memory half real rather than
# illustrative. Free tier is ample; create a database at https://upstash.com
# (or add the Upstash integration from the Vercel dashboard, which injects
# these two variables for you).
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=https://....upstash.io
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=...
